1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,865
Robert Pattinson is the new James Bond.

2
00:00:04,405 --> 00:00:06,877
Batman is stepping into Bond's shoes.

3
00:00:08,867 --> 00:00:12,881
On Monday, November sixteenth,
Amazon MGM Studios made it official.

4
00:00:13,141 --> 00:00:16,558
Robert Pattinson will play James Bond
in the next double-oh seven film.

5
00:00:16,818 --> 00:00:19,845
The news quickly shot to the top
of the trends around the world.

6
00:00:20,135 --> 00:00:24,628
Pattinson is forty years old, and he
becomes the seventh actor to play the spy,

7
00:00:24,668 --> 00:00:27,383
after Sean Connery, George
Lazenby, Roger Moore,

8
00:00:27,423 --> 00:00:30,137
Timothy Dalton, Pierce
Brosnan and Daniel Craig.

9
00:00:30,397 --> 00:00:32,333
He called the role the
honour of a lifetime.

10
00:00:33,467 --> 00:00:38,001
Denis Villeneuve, who also directs the
Dune films, will direct the new Bond film.

11
00:00:38,261 --> 00:00:43,070
Steven Knight is writing the script, and
Amy Pascal and David Heyman are producing.

12
00:00:43,360 --> 00:00:46,346
Villeneuve said there can
only be one double-oh seven,

13
00:00:46,386 --> 00:00:49,597
and that Pattinson has the
timeless soul of the character.

14
00:00:49,857 --> 00:00:54,800
Studio executives praised his range and
what they called his quiet intensity.

15
00:00:55,934 --> 00:01:00,447
Many people first knew Pattinson as
Cedric Diggory in a Harry Potter film,

16
00:01:00,487 --> 00:01:02,785
and then as Edward Cullen in Twilight.

17
00:01:03,045 --> 00:01:07,088
In two thousand twenty-two he played Batman, and a sequel is still in production.

18
00:01:07,348 --> 00:01:10,119
So the man who plays Batman
is about to play Bond.

19
00:01:10,409 --> 00:01:13,786
Before the announcement, a long
list of names had been floated,

20
00:01:13,826 --> 00:01:17,854
including Henry Cavill, Aaron Taylor-Johnson, Jacob Elordi and Jack Lowden.

21
00:01:18,114 --> 00:01:21,641
In September, actor Gary Oldman
said he was not leaking anything,

22
00:01:21,681 --> 00:01:23,562
but that there were six candidates.

23
00:01:24,700 --> 00:01:28,830
Amazon bought MGM in two thousand twenty-two, and in two thousand twenty-five

24
00:01:28,870 --> 00:01:34,245
it took creative control of Bond from the longtime producers Barbara Broccoli and Michael G. Wilson.

25
00:01:34,505 --> 00:01:37,756
Now one of the biggest questions
of that new era has an answer.

26
00:01:38,046 --> 00:01:39,696
The timing is striking.

27
00:01:39,956 --> 00:01:43,400
It comes twenty years after Casino
Royale introduced Daniel Craig,

28
00:01:43,440 --> 00:01:47,306
whose last Bond film, No Time to Die,
earned more than seven hundred fifty

29
00:01:47,346 --> 00:01:48,678
million dollars worldwide.

30
00:01:49,834 --> 00:01:51,454
No release date has been announced.

31
00:01:51,714 --> 00:01:53,716
One report says filming
should start next year,

32
00:01:53,756 --> 00:01:56,714
for a release in two thousand
twenty-eight, but nothing is confirmed.

33
00:01:56,974 --> 00:01:59,764
No co-stars, no villain and
no title have been revealed.

34
00:02:00,054 --> 00:02:01,764
Pattinson will stay busy.

35
00:02:02,024 --> 00:02:05,684
He appears in Dune Part Three, which
opens in theaters on December eighteenth,

36
00:02:05,724 --> 00:02:07,914
and The Batman Part Two
is still in production.

37
00:02:09,367 --> 00:02:12,747
Would YOU watch Batman become
Bond? Tell me in the comments.

